WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.193
You answer an enquiry.

00:00:02.473 --> 00:00:04.137
Copy the details into a sheet.

00:00:04.417 --> 00:00:05.783
Then chase an approval.

00:00:06.063 --> 00:00:08.601
By the time you're done, there's another one waiting.

00:00:09.401 --> 00:00:11.300
That's the everyday work we're looking at.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:15.740
The small, repeated jobs that take people away from running their business.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.143
Orelu is our way of working on that problem.

00:00:19.423 --> 00:00:23.903
We're building a family of software products, each focused on one business need.

00:00:24.703 --> 00:00:26.004
The approach is simple.

00:00:26.284 --> 00:00:27.585
Connect the information.

00:00:27.865 --> 00:00:29.529
Automate the repeated steps.

00:00:29.809 --> 00:00:33.521
And leave the important decisions with the people who know the business.

00:00:34.421 --> 00:00:36.256
Our first product is QuotePlate.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:40.675
It's nearly ready, and it's built around how restaurants buy their ingredients.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:42.569
Start with a menu.

00:00:42.849 --> 00:00:44.044
Review what you need.

00:00:44.324 --> 00:00:47.908
Then bring suppliers and price requests into the same workflow.

00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:51.396
Compare the quotes, including tax and delivery.

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:54.428
Make a decision, and keep a record of what arrives.

00:00:55.328 --> 00:00:58.059
We're Utsav and Ria, two founders in India.

00:00:58.339 --> 00:01:02.221
We're still early, listening to business owners across different industries.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:06.691
We start with one task, clear access rules, and a small pilot.

00:01:06.971 --> 00:01:08.699
If it helps, we build from there.

00:01:09.599 --> 00:01:11.881
Got something your team keeps doing the hard way?

00:01:12.161 --> 00:01:12.951
Tell us.

00:01:13.231 --> 00:01:14.063
Orelu.

00:01:14.343 --> 00:01:15.900
Make everyday work easier.
